==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (4,000%) spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**1 [[Razorback]] spawns.
**1 [[Boraphim]] spawns.
**1 [[Bore]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This is a fairly standard stage. Since the Bores aren't paired with a longer-ranged enemy and you have infinite time to build a wall of cats on the beginning peons, you can just use [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]], [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]], and [[Juliet Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Juliet the Maiko]]/[[Talents|Talented]] [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo]] to permafreeze the Bores.

